Spec: Agent peer authorization source

Purpose:
  Supply authenticated service leases to an actual Java peer connection without SDK credentials.

Owns:
  ./PeerLeaseSource.java

References:
  ./ControlClient.sdd
  /transport-core/src/main/java/dev/linkgate/transport/PeerClient.sdd

Must:
  Acquire exact application/service authority before the peer opens, compare protocol and logical authority and retain one lease window.
  Renew before the signed remaining lifetime falls below sixty seconds and preserve unchanged authority generations; a changed or closed source never revives an existing stream.
  Expose only a bounded Agent callback used by the secure peer transport; do not change public business SDK shapes.
